namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIDataAsTexture {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIDataAsTexture.h#DreamUIDataAsTexture
    src   "Rows of a texture handed out as blocks: a canvas's widget data, its clip data, the rect blocks' data. The rows\nlive in a UDreamUIDataTexture, which grows in place when they run out, so the texture this hands out is the same\nobject for as long as this lives, and whatever binds it follows every growth."
    text  "以块的形式分发的纹理行：画布的控件数据、其裁剪数据、矩形块的数据。这些行\n存放在UDreamUIDataTexture中，用尽时会就地增长，因此此对象存活期间所分发的纹理始终是同一个\n对象，任何绑定它的对象都会随之跟进每一次增长。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDataAsTexture:Texture {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIDataAsTexture.h#DreamUIDataAsTexture:Texture
    src   "Texture to fill buffer data, and decode to buffer in shader. Made at run time in the transient\npackage, and never saved, duplicated or copied: a copy would carry none of its size (see CreateTexture)."
    text  "用于填充缓冲区数据、并在着色器中解码到缓冲区的纹理。在运行时于瞬态\n包中创建，从不保存、复制或拷贝：副本不会带有其大小（参见CreateTexture）。"
    state machine
}
